# Description: Potential adversaries stopping ETW providers recording loaded .NET assemblies.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((registry_key_name="*\\COMPlus_ETWEnabled" OR registry_key_name="*\\COMPlus_ETWFlags") AND (Details=0 OR Details="DWORD (0x00000000)")) OR (registry_key_name="*SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\.NETFramework\\ETWEnabled" AND Details="DWORD (0x00000000)"))
